courier (1.1.22) unstable; urgency=medium

  * An IMAP connection opens only when a call needs the server: a search
    or read the local index answers makes none, and in:sent is served
    from the index when the Sent folder is synced.
  * read --message-id resolves the message through the local index
    first, falling back to a live search.
  * An explicit --cc on a reply-all adds to the thread's Cc instead of
    replacing it; Cc is deduplicated case-insensitively. Closes #70.
  * Every run keeps the Claude Code command file current;
    install-claude-command writes it unconditionally and no longer takes
    --yes.

 -- Weiwu Zhang <a@colourful.land>  Fri, 16 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000

